  "applicationText": {
    "title": "北京ダック",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l34-app-block-001",
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "森和小李为了祝贺与小野的重逢，预订了北京有名的烤鸭店。小野到北京的第二天，三个人一起去吃饭。",
        "translationZh": "森和小李为了庆祝与小野重逢，预订了北京一家有名的烤鸭店。小野到北京的第二天，三个人一起去吃饭。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "森和小李为了祝贺与小野的重逢，预订了北京有名的烤鸭店。小野到北京的第二天，三个人一起去吃饭。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l34-app-block-002",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "傍晚，森和小李去宾馆接小野",
        "translationZh": "傍晚，森和小李去宾馆接小野。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（傍晚，森和小李去宾馆接小野）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l34-app-block-003",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "小野さんを歓迎するために、とっておきのお店を予約しておきましたよ。",
            "translationZh": "为了欢迎小野女士，我已经预订了一家特别好的店。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：小野さんを歓迎するために、とっておきのお店を予約しておきましたよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l34-app-block-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson34/l34-app-block-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.38,
              "duration": 4.38,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:15:28.937Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "8ea582bf99779fa38734f8a2ac468766d9d0ecf4b38e4bd1ab234ee28c324e3a"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "本当ですか!? ありがとうございます。",
            "translationZh": "真的吗！？谢谢您。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：本当ですか!? ありがとうございます。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l34-app-block-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson34/l34-app-block-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.78,
              "duration": 1.78,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:15:28.937Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "8ea582bf99779fa38734f8a2ac468766d9d0ecf4b38e4bd1ab234ee28c324e3a"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-003-line-003",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "北京ダックがおいしいお店なんですよ。",
            "translationZh": "这是一家北京烤鸭很好吃的店。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：北京ダックがおいしいお店なんですよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l34-app-block-003-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson34/l34-app-block-003-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.42,
              "duration": 2.42,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:15:28.937Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "8ea582bf99779fa38734f8a2ac468766d9d0ecf4b38e4bd1ab234ee28c324e3a"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l34-app-block-004",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "在餐厅，烤鸭端了上来",
        "translationZh": "在餐厅，烤鸭端上来了。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（在餐厅，烤鸭端了上来）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l34-app-block-005",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-005-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "うわあ、きれいに焼いてありますね。",
            "translationZh": "哇，烤得真漂亮啊。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：うわあ、きれいに焼いてありますね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l34-app-block-005-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson34/l34-app-block-005-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.66,
              "duration": 2.66,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:15:28.937Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "8ea582bf99779fa38734f8a2ac468766d9d0ecf4b38e4bd1ab234ee28c324e3a"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-005-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ええ。おいしそうな色でしょう。",
            "translationZh": "是啊，看起来颜色很诱人吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ええ。おいしそうな色でしょう。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l34-app-block-005-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson34/l34-app-block-005-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.54,
              "duration": 1.54,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:15:28.937Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "8ea582bf99779fa38734f8a2ac468766d9d0ecf4b38e4bd1ab234ee28c324e3a"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l34-app-block-006",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "厨师在身边削着烤鸭，服务员小姐把削好的烤鸭卷在薄饼里递给小野",
        "translationZh": "厨师在旁边片着烤鸭，服务员把片好的烤鸭卷在薄饼里递给小野。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（厨师在身边削着烤鸭，服务员小姐把削好的烤鸭卷在薄饼里递给小野）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l34-app-block-007",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-007-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "おいしい! 今まで、こんなにおいしいの食べたことありません。",
            "translationZh": "真好吃！我从没吃过这么好吃的东西。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：（尝了一口）おいしい! 今まで、こんなにおいしいの食べたことありません。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l34-app-block-007-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson34/l34-app-block-007-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.31,
              "duration": 5.31,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:15:28.937Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "8ea582bf99779fa38734f8a2ac468766d9d0ecf4b38e4bd1ab234ee28c324e3a"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-007-line-002",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "本場の料理は最高でしょう？",
            "translationZh": "原产地的菜肴最棒吧？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：本場の料理は最高でしょう？",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l34-app-block-007-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson34/l34-app-block-007-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.14,
              "duration": 2.14,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:15:28.937Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "8ea582bf99779fa38734f8a2ac468766d9d0ecf4b38e4bd1ab234ee28c324e3a"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-007-line-003",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "ええ、最高! 今度は自分で包んでみます。",
            "translationZh": "是的，太棒了！下次我自己试着卷。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：ええ、最高! 今度は自分で包んでみます。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l34-app-block-007-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson34/l34-app-block-007-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.78,
              "duration": 3.78,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:15:28.937Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "8ea582bf99779fa38734f8a2ac468766d9d0ecf4b38e4bd1ab234ee28c324e3a"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l34-app-block-007-line-004",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "ほかにも料理はたくさん頼んでありますからね。",
            "translationZh": "另外还已经点了很多菜呢。",
            "confidence": "high",
